flowchart LR
    user[User / Recruiter / Tester] -->|HTTPS request| ingress[Azure Container Apps Ingress]
    ingress -->|Port 8080| app[FastAPI Container App]
    app -->|Structured logs| logs[Log Analytics Workspace]
    app -->|Managed identity| identity[User-Assigned Managed Identity]
    identity -->|AcrPull| acr[Azure Container Registry]
    identity -->|Secret read scope| kv[Azure Key Vault]
    github[GitHub Repository] -->|Actions: tests, Gitleaks, Trivy| ci[CI Security Workflow]
    ci -->|Build image| acr
    terraform[Terraform] -->|Provision resources| azure[Azure Resource Group]
    azure --> ingress
    azure --> logs
    azure --> acr
    azure --> kv
